"entity": {
"name": "Crocs, Inc.",
"description": "Crocs, Inc. engages in the design, development, manufacture, worldwide marketing, sale, and distribution of lifestyle footwear and accessories. It operates through the Crocs Brand and HEYDUDE Brand segments. The Crocs Brand segment refers to the United States, South Korea, China, Japan, Singapore, Canada, Germany, Great Britain, France, Malaysia, Australia, Puerto Rico, the Netherlands, Australia, India, and Ireland. The HEYDUDE Brand segment focuses on the United States. The company was founded by Scott Seamans, George B. Boedecker, Jr., and Lyndon V. Hanson III in 2002 and is headquartered in Broomfield, CO.",
